cter  uh it was always that character  how does it work with um you know with a  film like this where you have the studio  and you have sega how much are they sort  of  in the weeds and sort of in there  figuring out like all the things you  want to do and how much about like the  balance of creative freedom versus what  the studios kind of want  oh it's they're great partners i mean we  were given a a a wonderful amount of  latitude after the first film to go off  to outline to kind of identify the broad  strokes of the story the character  development character arcs uh come back  pitch them on both sides in paramount  and sega uh and sort of just uh continue  to sort of work through the ideas with  them but we get a tremendous amount of  freedom but at the same time we're  obviously so respectful of sega's  characters it's so important that they  have a voice in the room and and and  they i mean have so much knowledge and  so much history of these characters  they're a wonderful resource they always  keep us on track in terms of just making  sure that that we're we're  uh giving fans the uh the the characters  the versions of the characters that they  know and love so it really is a team  effort uh and i'm so proud of of the the  film we made and sort of the result of  all that collaboration  i know that um they're doing like that  knuckles live action series and i would  imagine that they're going to explore  other options with the popularity of  these movies um are you you mentioned  you're not involved in these things is  it something that you want to be  involved with are you  you know what i mean oh i mean i i i  love these characters i love this movie  universe that we've built uh i think  there's so many exciting things possible  in the future uh again right now it's  just um so right now it's all about the  adrenaline of finally getting to share  this movie that we've been working on  for the last two years uh with audiences  i think they're gonna have such an  amazing time but yeah it's the the best  uh the best possible outcome would be to  get to tell more stories and to continue  like with knuckles i mean such an  incredible character i think fans are  going to just walk out of this movie  wanting more of him like immediately uh  and so yeah i mean it would be uh it'd  be wonderful to be part of that planning  on that note i gotta go i'm just gonna  say congrats and uh it's really hard to  do what you did and you did it thanks  steve i wish you nothing but the best  appreciate it man take care  you

